OL,3,ASkye Newman gets 'goosebumps' over
OL,4,Arecord-breaking Brixton Academy run
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC News's Mark Savage
OL,7,Fahead of her record-breaking run,
OL,8,FNewman said it had given her
OL,9,F"goosebumps and chills". She added:
OL,10,F"It's crazy. My jaw drops all the time.
OL,11,FI feel honoured to be the first woman,
OL,12,Fand I don't take it lightly."
